    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. When an enemy destroys a CHARACTER model from your GENESTEALER CULTS during Fight or while your opponent is shooting, select that casualty. Your models in NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS or ACOLYTE HYBRIDS units may reroll a 1 on Hit rolls against the killer’s unit. The same benefit applies to HYBRID METAMORPHS models. The benefit lasts until the battle is over. If you lost a MAGUS, a PRIMUS or an ACOLYTE ICONWARD, they may reroll any Hit roll against that enemy instead.",
